flowchart TD
    A[User selects Hindi, English, or Bengali] --> B[Submit question]
    B --> C[Normalize query and build cache key]
    C --> D{Retrieval cache hit?}
    D -->|yes| E[Reuse ranked passages]
    D -->|no| F[Tokenize query]
    F --> G[BM25 sparse retrieval]
    F --> H[ONNX embedding]
    H --> I[HNSW dense retrieval]
    G --> J[RRF fusion]
    I --> J
    J --> E
    E --> K{Out-of-dataset / low confidence?}
    K -->|yes| L[Abstain safely]
    K -->|no| M{RAG_ONLY or generate enabled?}
    M -->|RAG_ONLY| N[Extractive grounded answer]
    M -->|RAG+SLM| O{Response cache hit?}
    O -->|yes| P[Return cached grounded SLM answer]
    O -->|no| Q[Call SLM with timeout and fallback]
    Q --> P
    L --> R[Return response with citations / grounding metadata]
    N --> R
    P --> R
